//RS /// Bounded, source-attributed profile evidence.  This is the only profile
//RS /// recorder: aggregate wall/cpu samples remain in `TraceSample`, while these
//RS /// rows retain the sampling method, source identity, and explicit coverage
//RS /// state needed by CLI/devtools projections.
//RS ///
//RS /// The run window is the runtime's own account of the program run: wall time
//RS /// and process CPU since the Jet runtime started, so it excludes any
//RS /// in-process compile that the session wall/cpu samples include. `exit` means
//RS /// the runtime published it at its exit seam; `live` means the last periodic
//RS /// publication of a run that had not exited when captured.
